 ("p", "Inactivity is the greater cause of overweight these days. People physical activity had decreased these days. The main reason is there are many labour saving devices. They does not want to walk on foot. They spend enough time sitting and watch television. Their excess weight make them sick and they have to spend money in medicine."),
