 ("p", "One thing we all must do / to cooperate with police and pay heed to their advice. - missing **is**: 'One thing we all must do **is** to cooperate'. They warn us not / touch unidentified ... - missing **to**. 'unclaimed suspicious objects like transistors, brief cases etc.' - missing **and** before 'unclaimed'. 'we need / watch out for' - **to**. 'abandoned cars, scooters / report the details' - **and**. 'report the details / such objects' - **of**. 'to the nearest police control room / dialing 100' - **by**."),
