 ("h3", "Techniques"),
 ("ol", ["Read the passage once ignoring the blanks to get the sense and the tense.", "For each blank decide the word class needed: noun, verb, adjective, preposition, article, connector, relative pronoun.", "Test every option in the sentence and eliminate impossible ones (agreement, tense, collocation).", "Check collocations: 'made large buildings sway', 'caught people off guard', 'works as a predictor'.", "Check the sense of the surrounding sentences: cause / effect, contrast, addition."]),
