 ("h3", "Solved example"),
 ("p", "Tokyo was rocked by its (a) **biggest** earthquake in more than a year today, but escaped (b) **with** little damage because it (c) **was** centred far beneath the floor of the Pacific Ocean. The quake (d) **which** struck shortly before noon with a magnitude of 6.6, (e) **made** large buildings sway back and forth. The intense (f) **shaking** for about one minute caught people (g) **off** guard in Tokyo and other cities (h) **towards** the east."),
