 ("p", "Firstly, 500 ml of water **is boiled** in a container. After that noodles and taste makers **are added**. Then finely chopped vegetables **are added** after steaming them separately. The mixed stuff **is cooked** for only two minutes. It is then served hot."),
 ("h2", "Sentence Completion with Reported Speech"),
 ("p", "Read the conversation, then fill the blanks of the summary paragraph in reported speech (see Chapter 13). Typical pattern: *Anita asked Prakash (a) what he wanted to do that morning. Prakash answered that he (b) felt like taking a walk. It was so nice outside.* Check that the verb after the link word is backshifted and pronouns are changed."),
